cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the software and the paper below."
title: "agentic-kg-retrieval: modular agentic text-to-Cypher retrieval over knowledge graphs"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/GokhanDuruoglu/agentic-kg-retrieval"
abstract: >-
  Code, 2WikiMultihopQA data, graph-construction scripts and evaluation for a study of which components of an
  agentic text-to-Cypher pipeline (answer splitting, execution-feedback retries, query tools, chained
  sub-questions) earn their cost, compared with BM25, dense and GraphRAG retrieval.
keywords:
  - knowledge graphs
  - agentic retrieval
  - text-to-Cypher
  - GraphRAG
  - multi-hop question answering
